|                                                    |
|             1      3                               |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : janetMultVar M                                 |
|                                                    |
|o3 = {set {x2, x1}, set {x3, x2}, set {x3, x2, x1}} |
