multVars -- key in the cache table of a differential in a Janet resolution
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

The symbol multVars is used as a key in the cache table of a differential in a
resolution if it is constructed using *note janetResolution: janetResolution,.
In that case it stores the sets of multiplicative variables for the Janet basis
given by that differential.

